      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont wanna freak myself out or drive all the way to the clinic at this hour. my husband says i'm probably just retaining water because of the heat and the extra weight. do u think it could just be dehydration or something? like can i just take some extra water and rest it off til tomorrow morning?",
